Subject: [PATCH 01/10] Markdown preview: Source, Preview and Split views

Rendered preview with inline images, HTML blocks, alerts, Mermaid diagrams, code colours, an outline, a scroll map that keeps editor and preview in step, and text that the mouse can select and copy.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

